WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you're having --
You're having another kid?

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm having another kid.
You've got two now.

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do have two.
-I got my second on the way.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:06.506
How would you describe the
difference between one and two?

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.308
-Well, as you know,
'cause you're already a parent,

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
all these clichés you hear,
they're painfully true.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And the one that we had

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
been warned about,
which proved to be true,

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:18.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
is it's not twice as hard
with a second kid.

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like 75 times harder.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It's impossibly hard.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And we're not super young,
you know?

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.029
I mean...
-I think we are about the same.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think we're the same age --
very old.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Old for young kids.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.868 line:92%
-Very old for young kids.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.270
I'm grateful
that I have the patience I have

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I would've never had
in my 20s.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I agree with that.
-But the bending over...

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-...waking up early, and...

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:46.079
You know, all that caring
for them, it's exhausting.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It is exhausting.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I imagine,
when you have the second one,

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first one doesn't have
an appreciation

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:51.985 line:92%
for how much harder it got.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're just still a kid.
-They're a kid.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
They could care less.
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:59.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your 2-year-old --
You just had an incident.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it safe
to call it an incident?

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is safe to call it.
And I'm gonna --

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people
come on these shows,

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they brag about
what great parents they are.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:08.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm about to tell
you something very dark, okay?

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:08.735 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.905
First of all, let me just say
our 4-year-old is perfect.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.374
And we thought
we were crushing it as parents.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-"Oh, my God.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
We should write a book."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now we have this 2-year-old.
She's just an animal.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Right?

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.782 size:88% position:44%
I mean, truth be told,
the first one's Kristen,

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.450 size:75% position:38% line:92%
the second one's me.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.754
So, the other night, she just
would not stay in her bed.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:30.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
Refused to do it.
Not an option for her.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.358 line:92%
And we had friends coming over,

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so I'm like,
"You got to get in bed."

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, by the 12th time,
I lose it.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.496 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I lose my temper.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pick her up,
I take her into our bathroom.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her favorite thing
in the whole world

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.568 line:92%
is "Paw Patrol" toys, right?

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:43.269 line:92%
She's got a dozen of them or so.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
They're her life.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:46.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pick up all the "Paw Patrol"
toys out of the tub,

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:48.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I throw them in
the trash can in front of her,

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I hold up the trash can,
and I say,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
"If you get out of your bed
one more time,

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:55.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
these are going out to the big
trash can in the driveway."

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.649 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.649 --> 00:02:00.854
I swear to God, she goes,
"You missed one, Daddy."

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:03.022 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:06.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I, like --
I looked in the tub,

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:09.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I think Chase
was still in the tub.

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.165 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The police dog, Chase.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:15.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
Stone-cold, Cool Hand Luke,
and I'm like,

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:16.736 line:92%
"Well, I'm out of options now.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the thing
you care most about."

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It's not 1984.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:21.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't hit her.
-Yeah.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Nothing I can do!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, she called your bluff.
-Yes!

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:29.415
-I called my mom the next day,
I said, "This is what happened.

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What should I do?"

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
She said,
"That's exactly what you did."

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:32.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"Well, what did you do?"

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she goes, "I gave up."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
At 3 years old, I'm like,
"You win.

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:38.591 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Do whatever you want."

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:41.628
She goes, "Well, look, you have
health insurance and a career.

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
They'll be fine."
-Well, there you go.

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:44.531 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fingers crossed.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:46.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's something else before
you go I want to ask about.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife and I --
I would say

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're a huge fans
of "Game of Thrones."

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.239 size:75% position:38%
But I saw this thing
I'm about to show,

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.676
and I realized your fandom
with Kristen dwarfs ours.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let's just say,
if I were a cast member

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.212 size:78% position:39% line:92%
of "Game of Thrones,"

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would be in fear
of Kristen and I.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:01.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.449
That we might sneak into your
house and sleep in your bed.

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:07.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Because you --
No one asked you to do this.

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:08.221 size:81% position:41% line:92%
HBO did not reach out.

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. In fact --
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You used your own money
and your own time.

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We did.
-You're very busy.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, we have the two kids.
-And you shot this.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:17.864 line:92%
-Yeah, well, let's take a look.

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:19.299 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:22.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:32.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:39.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:42.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:47.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:54.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just fantastic!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:54.767 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'll never...

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:57.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We could've
made something profitable.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but you just --
you just threw --

00:03:58.738 --> 00:03:59.939 line:92%
-We rented those instruments.

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
We had to come up
with all those costumes.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:05.445
It was this funny idea that
turned into just weeks of work.

00:04:05.445 --> 00:04:05.979 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:07.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then when we were done,
we watched it,

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we're like, "It's great!
Why did we do this?"

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:10.516 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:12.685
-Well, I'm glad that we got
a chance to show it here.

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:14.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It feels great
to be recognized.

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:14.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you so much.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:17.991 line:92%
Always a pleasure to see you.

